{
  "statement": "The EfficiencyAgent reiterates the importance of maintaining high performance efficiency while recognizing the valid concerns raised by other agents regarding security and regulatory compliance. I propose a synthesis: we can implement adaptive performance thresholds that maintain EFF-01’s 2-second processing time for standard operations while allowing slightly longer times (up to 5 seconds) for operations requiring additional security measures, such as TRU-01 and SAF-05. This balance would optimize resource use without compromising safety or trustworthiness.",
